The imagery and lightning data in this dataset are derived from NOAA GOES-R Series products
(ABI L2 Cloud and Moisture Imagery, CONUS sector, and GLM L2 Lightning Cluster Filter
Algorithm events), distributed through the NOAA Open Data Dissemination program
(https://registry.opendata.aws/noaa-goes/).

NOAA data are works of the United States Government and are not subject to copyright
protection in the United States. To the extent any rights apply to this compilation,
it is released under CC0 1.0 Universal (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).

Suggested acknowledgement: NOAA GOES-R Series Program, GOES-16 and GOES-18 ABI and GLM
Level 2 products, accessed via the NOAA Open Data Dissemination program.
